{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do","id":1112856,"title":"If you see two supernatural fighting and oppresing one another what would you do?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-07T12:42:30-07:00","id":1112856,"title":"If you see two supernatural fighting and oppresing one another what would you do?","content":"Let's say a vampire is beating up a Changeling and sucking his/her blood. Do humans tend to look the other way because they know their place? Personally if you were a bystander, would you interfere?<br /> <br /> Would you interfere in supernatural business?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T12:57:56-07:00","id":1112863,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't really notice some of it, since changelings look like humans, and vampires often look like humans too.<br /> <br /> If I was absolutely sure that it was a vampire draining blood from someone, I would be more surprised than anything else. Incredibly surprised. I don't know about you, but I've lived most of my life accepting that there's no supernatural, and the monsters in our lives are entirely human. Even during my more exploratory periods I've found nothing to really warrant thinking there are monsters tearing people to shreds and ripping their lives apart. So I think even if I saw someone gnawing on someone's neck, and they 'hissed' at me or whatever when they saw me, I'd probably think it was some asshole with fake fangs. It would have to do more to really say, 'Vampire,' to me.<br /> <br /> And so if I saw what I thought was a human drinking another human's blood or attacking someone in a violent fashion, with the other person clearly hurt, I'd get involved. Though from an in-world point of view, a vampire can make 'the Kiss' a pleasurable experience so it just looks like someone is making out with the partner in an abusive relationship.<br /> <br /> If I saw something that was clearly 'inhuman monster' fighting 'inhuman monster,' I'd be a lot more interested in watching than interfering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T14:22:04-07:00","id":1112916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do?p=1112863#post1112863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't really notice some of it, since changelings look like humans, and vampires often look like humans too.<br /> <br /> If I was absolutely sure that it was a vampire draining blood from someone, I would be more surprised than anything else. Incredibly surprised. I don't know about you, but I've lived most of my life accepting that there's no supernatural, and the monsters in our lives are entirely human. Even during my more exploratory periods I've found nothing to really warrant thinking there are monsters tearing people to shreds and ripping their lives apart. So I think even if I saw someone gnawing on someone's neck, and they 'hissed' at me or whatever when they saw me, I'd probably think it was some asshole with fake fangs. It would have to do more to really say, 'Vampire,' to me.<br /> <br /> And so if I saw what I thought was a human drinking another human's blood or attacking someone in a violent fashion, with the other person clearly hurt, I'd get involved. Though from an in-world point of view, a vampire can make 'the Kiss' a pleasurable experience so it just looks like someone is making out with the partner in an abusive relationship.<br /> <br /> <b>If I saw something that was clearly 'inhuman monster' fighting 'inhuman monster,' I'd be a lot more interested in watching than interfering</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>You wouldn't run? Supernaturals aren't exactly friendly.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T14:23:46-07:00","id":1112919,"title":"","content":"Call the Union, they'll take care of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T14:31:00-07:00","id":1112922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magicballz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do#post1112856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's say a vampire is beating up a Changeling and sucking his/her blood. Do humans tend to look the other way because they know their place? Personally if you were a bystander, would you interfere?<br /> <br /> Would you interfere in supernatural business?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, given that this would look less like &quot;a vampire is feeding on a changeling&quot; and more &quot; that weird pale guy is hurting that random person,&quot; I would probably be a little bit frightened and call the cops?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T14:43:18-07:00","id":1112927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magicballz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do?p=1112916#post1112916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You wouldn't run? Supernaturals aren't exactly friendly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, is this 'I have the book and know how they work?'<br /> <br /> Because I'm going by the frame of reference where if monsters exist, they do so in secret. If I just ran, I might forget, or at least my memory would become unclear enough that I could second-guss what happened. If I watched and made sure, though, I'd always remember.<br /> <br /> Of course if it looked like the monster was 'finishing off' the other and getting ready to kill someone else, sure I'd run. But running from vampires and werewolves and wizards don't seem to work usually.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T14:55:35-07:00","id":1112935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do?p=1112922#post1112922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, given that this would look less like &quot;a vampire is feeding on a changeling&quot; and more &quot; that weird pale guy is hurting that random person,&quot; I would probably be a little bit frightened and call the cops?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hypothetically what would happen if you call the cops on a vampire or any supernatural? What would they do to protect themselves?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T15:09:33-07:00","id":1112947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magicballz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do#post1112856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's say a vampire is beating up a Changeling and sucking his/her blood. Do humans tend to look the other way because they know their place? Personally if you were a bystander, would you interfere?<br /> <br /> Would you interfere in supernatural business?</div> </div> </div> </div>The bystander effect is a real thing. As a ST, the whole scenario depends: Which one's the PC? The Vampire or the Changeling? Is it a PVP match? is the feeding violent or covert? Do I have an interesting mortal NPC ready to be introduced in such a fashion (doubtful)? Why should I provide a deus ex machina to save the changeling? I doubt the altercation happened in a vacuum, something happened to illicit the Kindred to such Masquerade breach, thus I wouldn't have mortals intervene, but another more rational Kindred definitively would, even if it's after the fact by hanging the episode over the aggressive vampire in blackmail fashion, whilst goading the imbecile to plug this masquerade breach.<br /> <br /> Context and details are important.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12191,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","user":"Malus","date":". 07-07-2017, 06:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T16:46:22-07:00","id":1112989,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://gifrific.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/09/leaving-now-grandpa-simpsons.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">10 characters.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T18:09:29-07:00","id":1113019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magicballz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do?p=1112935#post1112935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hypothetically what would happen if you call the cops on a vampire or any supernatural? What would they do to protect themselves?</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably go to ground and use what powers they had to make themselves relatively unmemorable. If they actually get pegged, most organization of monsters keep (or try to) keep some hooks into the various points of law enforcement and the judicial process to get them off the radar, but those things cost. And if one does not belong to such an organization, well, time to think like most criminals do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T18:09:53-07:00","id":1113020,"title":"","content":"Call the cops.Mostly because it wouldn't look supernatural to me.And yell at the weird pale dude to get off the other person, becuse I called the cops.<br /> AKA..<br /> I'm dead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8fsIR2T.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13566-kalzky","name":"Kalzky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13566_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T18:21:04-07:00","id":1113027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magicballz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do?p=1112935#post1112935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hypothetically what would happen if you call the cops on a vampire or any supernatural? What would they do to protect themselves?</div> </div> </div> </div>Leave is an easy one. Changelings especially have or had an easy way to escape nearly any situation. My changeling, when confronted by the police, talked his way out of the situation. My werewolf would probably eat them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T10:10:52-07:00","id":1113281,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do?p=1113019#post1113019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably go to ground and use what powers they had to make themselves relatively unmemorable. If they actually get pegged, most organization of monsters keep (or try to) keep some hooks into the various points of law enforcement and the judicial process to get them off the radar, but those things cost. And if one does not belong to such an organization, well, time to think like most criminals do.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know vampires def. belong to such organization. What about Changelings? Not sure if they have any hook. Supernaturals tend to get each other off the hook because if one goes down they all go down right?<br /> <br /> Humans would suspect other supernaturals might exist and that would be pretty bad I am guessing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T10:23:33-07:00","id":1113285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magicballz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do?p=1113281#post1113281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know vampires def. belong to such organization. What about Changelings? Not sure if they have any hook. Supernaturals tend to get each other off the hook because if one goes down they all go down right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really, and no. Changelings don't have large organizations but it would make sense for their smaller groups to try to get at least one 'in' on something in local government.<br /> <br /> The revelation of one monster does not instantly reveal to the world the existence of every other monster. Vampires are concerned about themselves, the individual vampire. Outing another in order to get them killed is a dangerous but still available option to deal with a rival. Even the 'no masquerade breaches allowed' groups tend to do it for other reasons. The Seers because it might inspire someone to Awaken outside of the Exarchs control.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Humans would suspect other supernaturals might exist and that would be pretty bad I am guessing. </div> </div> </div>Humans know the supernatural exists, for the most part. Near every human in the Chronicles of Darkness has experienced something supernatural, it's part of character creation. But going into your basement and finding a face in the floor that asks you to bring it people to eat in exchange for gold isn't going to clue you in on the secret society of vampires in the city. When it comes to the supernatural, the gamelines are far outnumbered by things like ghosts and spirits.<br /> <br /> In old World of Darkness it's more of an issue, as public 'acceptance' of the supernatural can shift the paradigm of their world. In Chronicles, it just makes things more scary. You feed a few of your friends to that face and now it's a torso and not a particularly friendly-looking one. You fill the basement with concrete, move, and spend the rest of your life avoiding poking around in weird mysteries because you want to live a long life.<br /> <br /> But we aren't raised in the Chronicles of Darkness so we're going to act differently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T13:54:01-07:00","id":1113361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magicballz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do?p=1113281#post1113281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know vampires def. belong to such organization. What about Changelings? Not sure if they have any hook. Supernaturals tend to get each other off the hook because if one goes down they all go down right?<br /> <br /> Humans would suspect other supernaturals might exist and that would be pretty bad I am guessing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on the freehold, as well as the pack/(Nameless) Order/throng/cell OR compact OR conspiracy/krewe/cult/Agency/brood. Certain organizations of monsters are better at getting the sort of resources to help with this kind of crap than others, and a lot of that goes down to the makeup of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T05:06:09-07:00","id":1114533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magicballz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1112856-if-you-see-two-supernatural-fighting-and-oppresing-one-another-what-would-you-do#post1112856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's say a vampire is beating up a Changeling and sucking his/her blood. Do humans tend to look the other way because they know their place? Personally if you were a bystander, would you interfere?<br /> <br /> Would you interfere in supernatural business?</div> </div> </div> </div>First off how do you recognize that it's supernatural business? The victim is likely to at least look human because they haven't pulled all their powers.<br /> That said I agree the bystander affect being real, but so is mob mentality. If there are mortal witness who are not hysterically participating in the oppression the even though they are witnessing it they are likely to become Hunters that negatively view the oppressor. If they were part of a mob oppressing the victim then they'll like rationalize their actions as either justified or forgettable. Also being ppart of an angry mob does wonders for befuddling the memory. <br /> It behooves the oppressor to turn any humans against their supernatural prey.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}